WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:04.700
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:04.700 --> 00:08.270
Omoi wa kouya o yuku

00:08.270 --> 00:16.180
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

00:21.350 --> 00:27.990
Yaketsuku hizashi no moto kimi wa nani omou?

00:27.990 --> 00:33.900
Urei no hitomi wa ima nani o utsusu?

00:33.900 --> 00:42.840
Mayowazu ni irareru no nara
step by step tayasui darou

00:42.840 --> 00:47.540
Kaze no you ni

00:47.540 --> 00:50.650
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:50.650 --> 00:54.150
Akatsuki no kouya o yuku

00:54.150 --> 01:00.690
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

01:00.690 --> 01:07.430
Don't be afraid kawaru koto wa
osoreru koto ja nai

01:07.430 --> 01:13.570
Kimi ga kimi de aru naraba will be with you

01:13.570 --> 01:20.240
Odayaka na hi o yume-mite

01:20.240 --> 01:27.550
Michi-naki tabiji wa tsuzuku

01:31.390 --> 01:35.360
I swear! Damn piece of junk!

01:35.360 --> 01:39.290
Ellis, are you aware of what's going on here?

01:39.290 --> 01:40.760
It broke.

01:40.760 --> 01:43.300
And you're not moved to do something about it?

01:43.300 --> 01:45.370
Would you rather I did something?

01:45.370 --> 01:47.730
Yeah, if you don't want to shrivel up and die.

01:54.810 --> 01:57.610
If you have any last words, say them now.

01:59.050 --> 02:00.380
Look what I found.

02:00.380 --> 02:01.870
Huh?

02:08.790 --> 02:11.490
There's nothing out there. Absolutely nothing.

02:11.490 --> 02:14.260
- Nope.
- Nope.

02:16.730 --> 02:17.800
What about that?

02:17.800 --> 02:19.900
Huh?

02:19.900 --> 02:21.670
- Oh!
- Okay?

02:21.670 --> 02:23.070
It's a diner!

02:23.070 --> 02:24.440
It's way okay!

02:24.440 --> 02:26.100
All right, let's go!

02:28.640 --> 02:31.080
What's your eyesight?

02:31.080 --> 02:32.580
Two eyes?

02:32.580 --> 02:33.780
Huh?

02:33.780 --> 02:38.180
There is still much that remains
unknown about Ellis's basic powers.

02:46.430 --> 02:47.990
Hi!

02:49.500 --> 02:52.100
Hi! Anyone here?!

02:52.100 --> 02:55.840
- Hello?!
- Shut up!

02:55.840 --> 02:58.040
Quit yelling.

02:58.040 --> 03:00.210
Sheesh. I was napping here.

03:00.210 --> 03:02.110
Oh, sorry...

03:11.150 --> 03:12.980
You...

03:14.220 --> 03:16.960
Oh, my stomach growled.

03:16.960 --> 03:20.190
Well, we haven't eaten all day, so...

03:29.400 --> 03:31.310
Looks like there's something up with you two.

03:31.310 --> 03:34.040
Huh? Well, kind of...

03:34.040 --> 03:35.910
Is there anything you don't like?

03:35.910 --> 03:38.680
- Drunkards.
- Huh?

03:38.680 --> 03:40.180
I meant food.

03:40.180 --> 03:42.180
I'm not a picky eater.

03:42.180 --> 03:43.320
Okay.

03:43.320 --> 03:46.320
Oh, I can't handle anything too spicy.

03:46.320 --> 03:48.690
I don't have any food
to serve to a bounty hunter.

03:48.690 --> 03:50.330
What?

03:50.330 --> 03:53.390
Folk who get paid for
committing murder are scum.

03:53.390 --> 03:56.330
Hold on, isn't that rather rude?

03:56.330 --> 03:58.500
I don't know what reason you've got,

03:58.500 --> 04:01.700
but nothing good will come
of being with the likes of her.

04:01.700 --> 04:02.870
Break it off with her.

04:02.870 --> 04:06.670
What?! This is none of your business, lady!

04:08.610 --> 04:09.940
You broke it.

04:09.940 --> 04:12.350
No way...

04:12.350 --> 04:15.210
It's because this thing was too fragile...

04:20.460 --> 04:23.020
You're going to work for me for a while.

04:24.860 --> 04:27.630
Yes, ma'am.

04:27.630 --> 04:31.730
You don't need to work. Eat up.

04:31.730 --> 04:34.470
I'll eat together with Nadie later.

04:34.470 --> 04:36.300
Open your mouth.

04:38.970 --> 04:40.740
Chocolate.

04:42.740 --> 04:45.410
Ah, you have healthy teeth, free of cavities.

04:45.410 --> 04:47.050
A chocolate for me, too.

04:47.050 --> 04:49.750
- Why?
- That's my line.

04:49.750 --> 04:51.050
Work.

04:51.050 --> 04:53.320
- Slave driver.
- Pay for the damage.

04:53.320 --> 04:55.390
Hello, Frida.

04:55.390 --> 04:57.590
Oh, Lopez, welcome!

04:57.590 --> 05:00.230
Oh? You hired some young girls?

05:00.230 --> 05:02.990
- Chocolate.
- Enough.

05:05.670 --> 05:07.640
Thanks for the food!

05:07.640 --> 05:09.900
Ah, a full stomach makes me happy!

05:09.900 --> 05:12.840
Okay, Nadie, there's an incinerator out back,

05:12.840 --> 05:14.410
so go burn the garbage for me.

05:14.410 --> 05:17.450
What?! Come on, let me rest a little!

05:17.450 --> 05:19.640
I just finished eating.

05:22.820 --> 05:25.590
I'm off to burn the trash!

05:25.590 --> 05:26.620
What about Ellis?

05:26.620 --> 05:29.120
You're fine where you are.

05:29.120 --> 05:32.360
Only fools get to work
straight after they've eaten.

05:32.360 --> 05:33.850
Hey!

05:35.860 --> 05:37.630
That damn hag...

05:37.630 --> 05:39.500
I'll kill her three times over later!

05:39.500 --> 05:42.770
And she called it an incinerator,
but it's just an oil drum!

05:44.270 --> 05:47.610
You'll be in the smoke
if you stand downwind of it.

05:47.610 --> 05:49.480
I know that!

05:49.480 --> 05:51.100
Here.

05:52.210 --> 05:53.480
Oh...

05:53.480 --> 05:56.020
Is that right? Your jeep, huh?

05:56.020 --> 05:58.190
Yeah, it broke.

05:58.190 --> 06:00.990
All right, I'll take a look at it for you later.

06:00.990 --> 06:06.460
But Ellis, what in the world are
you doing with a bounty hunter?

06:06.460 --> 06:08.900
Because Ellis is a bounty.

06:10.800 --> 06:15.140
Ellis killed the Doctor...

06:15.140 --> 06:17.130
Wiñay Marka...

06:21.140 --> 06:23.910
Just who are you?

06:23.910 --> 06:25.880
The owner of this restaurant.

06:25.880 --> 06:29.320
No, that's not what I meant...

06:29.320 --> 06:30.820
Oh, well.

06:30.820 --> 06:33.550
Why did you become a
bounty hunter of all things?

06:33.550 --> 06:37.660
There must have been plenty of
other ways for you to make a living.

06:37.660 --> 06:39.730
Up we go!

06:39.730 --> 06:43.160
It's a nice, carefree life,
being a bounty hunter.

06:43.160 --> 06:48.500
If you seriously believe that,
you're pretty stupid.

06:48.500 --> 06:51.010
You know, are you trying to make me mad?

06:51.010 --> 06:53.340
I just speak my mind.

06:55.510 --> 06:57.340
I'll kill her four times over.

07:02.250 --> 07:03.950
There.

07:08.720 --> 07:11.090
I'm done with the garbage.

07:11.090 --> 07:12.860
Huh? Where's Frida?

07:12.860 --> 07:14.950
She went out for supplies.

07:18.770 --> 07:20.870
Talk about careless.

07:20.870 --> 07:25.110
It's proof that she trusts you girls.

07:25.110 --> 07:27.880
She's too trusting.

07:27.880 --> 07:30.710
- Oh, the jeep...
- Huh?

07:30.710 --> 07:34.420
I went and took a look at
it just now. It's the engine.

07:34.420 --> 07:36.450
I don't have the tools today,
so it'll have to be tomorrow.

07:36.450 --> 07:39.320
You're going to fix it for us?! Thanks!

07:39.320 --> 07:40.720
Get me a coffee.

07:40.720 --> 07:42.780
Roger that. I'll get you an extra big cup.

07:45.460 --> 07:47.560
That's Maria.

07:47.560 --> 07:49.230
Maria?

07:49.230 --> 07:52.900
Frida's... daughter.

07:52.900 --> 07:55.300
Daughter? Is she here?

07:55.300 --> 07:57.310
No, she's at an orphanage right now.

07:57.310 --> 08:00.070
Orphanage? So Frida gave her up...

08:00.070 --> 08:01.840
She admitted herself to the orphanage

08:01.840 --> 08:04.910
when she learned that her
mother was a bounty hunter.

08:04.910 --> 08:07.450
A bounty hunter?! Frida?!

08:07.450 --> 08:10.510
Sure was. Supposedly a pretty good one, too.

08:11.920 --> 08:14.650
Then, what's she doing with this restaurant?

08:16.160 --> 08:18.430
"Murderer."

08:18.430 --> 08:23.130
That was the last word Maria
spoke to Frida when she left.

08:25.670 --> 08:28.100
Right after that, Frida washed
her hands of the business

08:28.100 --> 08:31.500
and opened this restaurant.
That was 10 years ago.

08:33.270 --> 08:35.780
She apparently wrote Maria
a letter telling her so, but...

08:35.780 --> 08:38.450
There was no response...

08:38.450 --> 08:39.850
Yeah.

08:39.850 --> 08:42.680
But Frida's waiting.

08:42.680 --> 08:46.120
Patiently... waiting.

08:49.120 --> 08:52.330
Being separated...

08:52.330 --> 08:54.160
...is painful.

09:11.010 --> 09:13.650
Sorry. You wanted coffee, right?

09:13.650 --> 09:15.020
Hot!

09:15.020 --> 09:17.220
Aw, now I've done it!

09:17.220 --> 09:19.520
Gramps, could you pretend you didn't see that?

09:19.520 --> 09:22.150
Sure, I don't mind, but...

09:32.030 --> 09:36.370
Sheesh! Washing this thing
isn't going to get it clean!

09:36.370 --> 09:39.510
Nadie, don't forget to wax it, too.

09:39.510 --> 09:41.340
What?!

09:42.540 --> 09:45.880
Maybe I should polish it with
some engine oil, you damn hag!

10:18.050 --> 10:19.880
Someone coming after you?

10:19.880 --> 10:21.540
I'm not sure.

10:25.550 --> 10:29.790
Oh, it's a coyote. They come to pick
through the garbage sometimes.

10:29.790 --> 10:32.260
What? You can tell by smell?

10:32.260 --> 10:34.230
Something like that.

10:34.230 --> 10:35.730
Impressed now?

10:35.730 --> 10:38.760
- Not really.
- That's too bad.

10:57.650 --> 11:00.590
That was... useful.

11:09.600 --> 11:12.830
Ah... Ellis.

11:23.140 --> 11:25.780
- What is this?
- What? Um...

11:25.780 --> 11:28.520
As you can see, this is a
compilation of the records

11:28.520 --> 11:30.280
left by Dr. Schneider concerning Ellis...

11:30.280 --> 11:34.390
All you did was neatly reorganize the records.

11:34.390 --> 11:36.460
Uh, sir?

11:36.460 --> 11:41.560
I have already looked through
the actual records numerous times.

11:41.560 --> 11:46.170
What I wanted from you was a new perspective.

11:46.170 --> 11:49.470
Activity or behaviors that appear periodically.

11:49.470 --> 11:53.010
Proper nouns that are used
frequently and with significance.

11:53.010 --> 11:57.910
Changes in the writing style
that appear to involve emotion.

11:57.910 --> 12:01.650
I'd think there are plenty of angles
around which to organize this data.

12:01.650 --> 12:03.240
Yes, sir...

12:06.350 --> 12:08.060
Rosenberg.

12:08.060 --> 12:10.490
Ah! My dear Madam!

12:10.490 --> 12:13.860
You did a magnificent job
throwing that party the other day.

12:13.860 --> 12:17.030
I must apologize for being such
an inexperienced toastmaster.

12:17.030 --> 12:20.000
I'm afraid I may have greatly
offended His Excellency...

12:21.700 --> 12:25.170
Is that so? I am most glad to hear that.

12:25.170 --> 12:29.340
Oh, yes, Madam, do you like caviar?

12:29.340 --> 12:32.050
Yes, I've obtained some excellent caviar...

12:32.050 --> 12:34.410
Damn that perverted bastard.

12:36.720 --> 12:39.350
Oh, Miss Hayward.

12:39.350 --> 12:43.790
Um, about the investigative expenses
that I have been asking about...

12:45.730 --> 12:48.860
Please pardon me. I have to go meet someone.

12:48.860 --> 12:51.300
Another day. See you.

12:51.300 --> 12:52.930
What? Um...

13:02.110 --> 13:05.140
Go ahead, you just enjoy
your freedom while you can.

13:11.920 --> 13:14.050
Looks like you got it fixed.

13:14.050 --> 13:17.660
I could do that kind of repair
with my eyes closed.

13:17.660 --> 13:19.390
Oh? Where's Nadie?

13:19.390 --> 13:23.660
Out for supplies. I forgot
to buy beans yesterday.

13:23.660 --> 13:25.970
Ellis, order up.

13:25.970 --> 13:27.460
Yessir.

13:32.640 --> 13:34.400
Yessir.

13:49.820 --> 13:52.930
Tell me what my objective is already.

13:52.930 --> 13:56.990
It's stressful to just go from place
to place according to your instructions.

14:05.510 --> 14:07.710
- Nadie.
- Where are you right now?

14:07.710 --> 14:09.140
Some town.

14:09.140 --> 14:12.280
Never mind that. Blue-eyes,
I have a question for you.

14:12.280 --> 14:14.820
- What about Ellis?
- I have her with me.

14:14.820 --> 14:17.020
My question is about Ellis.

14:17.020 --> 14:19.490
Just who is she?

14:19.490 --> 14:24.230
You just have to protect Ellis
until you have further instructions.

14:24.230 --> 14:26.690
Oh! Hello?! Hello...

14:26.690 --> 14:29.630
Sheesh! That damn woman
may as well be a machine!

14:38.170 --> 14:40.310
Uh...

14:40.310 --> 14:42.140
Oh, boy...

14:43.640 --> 14:45.130
Here.

14:51.420 --> 14:52.850
Did you get that from her?

14:52.850 --> 14:54.860
Thanks.

14:54.860 --> 14:56.550
Oh, it's nothing...

15:00.690 --> 15:03.890
Come on, Lirio, let's go.

15:08.100 --> 15:10.440
Could they be family?

15:10.440 --> 15:12.200
Well, whatever.

15:57.920 --> 15:59.980
So you finally came to see her.

16:01.590 --> 16:03.120
Now, then...

16:03.120 --> 16:04.560
Going home?

16:04.560 --> 16:07.330
Yeah. Thanks for the food.

16:07.330 --> 16:08.960
It's burning.

16:16.070 --> 16:19.070
- She's a good person.
- What?

16:19.070 --> 16:21.740
A woman managing a restaurant all by herself...

16:21.740 --> 16:23.340
It's impressive.

16:23.340 --> 16:26.250
Though, well, she's got a real mouth on her.

16:30.250 --> 16:33.950
She's... not the person she used to be anymore.

16:36.420 --> 16:40.260
She's been waiting for you... all this time.

17:27.640 --> 17:29.230
The flames...

17:39.490 --> 17:43.390
That bastard... My Ellis... How dare he?

17:45.030 --> 17:47.490
It's flaring up again!

17:47.490 --> 17:49.830
Why? How did it end up on fire?

17:52.830 --> 17:54.320
Frida?!

17:55.500 --> 17:57.330
What's going on?

18:02.210 --> 18:04.940
What the hell? What's going on?

18:11.520 --> 18:13.020
Damn it!

18:13.020 --> 18:16.760
Give that girl back to me.

18:16.760 --> 18:18.350
Now.

18:45.620 --> 18:47.420
Murderer!

18:54.630 --> 18:56.400
Ellis?

18:56.400 --> 18:58.160
Frida?

19:17.450 --> 19:20.620
This is the guy from...

19:20.620 --> 19:22.820
Frida...

19:22.820 --> 19:27.320
He set fire to the bike and tried to
take Ellis while we were distracted.

19:37.500 --> 19:39.770
Ellis!

19:39.770 --> 19:40.810
Are you hurt?

19:40.810 --> 19:42.940
What do you mean?

19:42.940 --> 19:44.930
As long as you're safe.

19:53.350 --> 19:55.180
What are you playing at?

19:57.120 --> 19:58.850
Frida.

20:14.910 --> 20:17.380
All right! Now I'll be rich!

20:17.380 --> 20:19.350
What?

20:19.350 --> 20:22.180
This guy's got a big bounty on his head.

20:22.180 --> 20:25.320
I'm so lucky I ran into him here!

20:25.320 --> 20:29.590
You're... a bounty hunter?

20:29.590 --> 20:32.890
This person was a bounty?

20:32.890 --> 20:35.500
You don't have to make
any unnecessary comments.

20:35.500 --> 20:38.330
You're going to complicate things here!

20:38.330 --> 20:42.900
Gramps, sorry about this,
but help me carry him.

20:42.900 --> 20:45.610
Nadie, you...

20:45.610 --> 20:47.340
Come on, hurry up.

20:47.340 --> 20:48.930
Hurry up.

21:02.020 --> 21:05.530
Nadie, maybe the truth should...

21:05.530 --> 21:07.120
Frida.

21:09.360 --> 21:11.930
I'm sorry about this, Nadie.

21:11.930 --> 21:13.530
It's okay.

21:13.530 --> 21:16.240
You protected Ellis for me.

21:16.240 --> 21:19.260
So it's my turn to do the protecting now.

21:21.710 --> 21:23.810
You be good to each other now!

21:23.810 --> 21:27.210
After all, you two are the only
family you've got in the world.

21:27.210 --> 21:28.920
Nadie...

21:28.920 --> 21:30.550
Thank you.

21:30.550 --> 21:32.420
Woohoo!

21:32.420 --> 21:34.250
Oh, I guess you've got three in the world.

21:34.250 --> 21:35.560
So long.

21:35.560 --> 21:37.760
Gramps, thanks for the jeep.

21:37.760 --> 21:40.290
Sure. You take care, too, Ellis.

21:40.290 --> 21:42.060
Yeah, I'll take care.

21:42.060 --> 21:43.650
Bye now!

21:48.740 --> 21:50.240
Nadie!

21:50.240 --> 21:53.670
I swear, she's one strong girl.

22:00.480 --> 22:03.070
- Maria!
- Mom!

22:21.670 --> 22:25.540
Nadie's assignment to accompany Ellis...

22:25.540 --> 22:30.370
That this will have a great
impact on her in the future...

22:32.150 --> 22:33.980
...is certain.

22:36.620 --> 22:40.350
Owaranai natsu no you ni

22:40.350 --> 22:43.890
Chiranai hana no you ni

22:43.890 --> 22:47.790
Dakishimeta sono ude o

22:47.790 --> 22:55.960
Zutto hanasanaide ite yo

23:02.210 --> 23:05.710
Sugari-tsuite-mitemo

23:05.710 --> 23:11.490
Mune wa mada chigau hakanasa de

23:11.490 --> 23:15.420
Toki no rizumu kazoeteru

23:15.420 --> 23:19.560
Akai hoshi no yoru

23:19.560 --> 23:23.560
Kiete-yuku nukumori

23:23.560 --> 23:27.500
Tsunagi-tometai no yo

23:27.500 --> 23:34.010
Hitomi tojita kimi o

23:34.010 --> 23:37.940
Akogare o kuri-kaeshi

23:37.940 --> 23:41.380
Doko e mo yukenaku-temo

23:41.380 --> 23:45.420
Setsunasa no tachidomaru

23:45.420 --> 23:51.790
Kono hito-toki ga futari no

23:51.790 --> 23:56.790
Subete yo
